WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Why are you so nosy?

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:06,610
I just care about you, Chen Mouyuan

3
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:07,890
How did you find it before?

4
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:12,700
Xianyuan can go back to the rabbit

5
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:15,140
He must be able to find one nearby.

6
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:16,260
Let's follow his route

7
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,180
I'm sure I can catch it too

8
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,900
Then don’t just analyze and find it.

9
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:19,980
Find one and come back

10
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:20,980
I'm the first to praise you

11
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:24,920
He doesn't even bother to show off to us now

12
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:26,840
Because people don’t need it at all

13
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:27,920
starting from tomorrow

14
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,920
I'd like to see the official actions of the tracking team.

15
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:32,080
Where on earth could he get so much stuff?

16
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:33,080
But make it clear first

17
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:34,680
Don't steal the prey he has already obtained

18
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:36,720
You are not allowed to touch anything on his camp island either.

19
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:40,000
He didn’t write his name, so it’s obvious that the materials were processed by the trap.

20
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,000
can prove ownership

21
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,480
If you really want to completely mess up the relationship, go do it yourself.

22
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:45,760
Don't ask everyone to accompany you

23
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:47,400
I'll take a look at it myself with me tomorrow.

24
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,040
Where did he hide his stuff?
